abstract: >-
  SecureEWS evaluates data-minimized educational early-warning systems as
  educator decision-support tools across review capacities and educational
  stages. The release contains code, frozen protocols, aggregate results,
  paired-bootstrap draws, verification reports, and manuscript materials.
keywords:
  - learning analytics
  - early-warning systems
  - data minimization
  - educator decision support
  - review capacity
  - responsible educational technology
  - residual attribute predictability
  - temporal evaluation
